  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you have a world that has been reported and has some report tags, if you view the page, then go to another world page via the website (without reloading the page), the reported tags will persist for every world you visit (that you are not the author of)\nIt looks like the clean up code for reported tags only runs when you are viewing the pages of worlds you created, and thus persist when visiting other worlds.\nReproduction steps:\n1. Visit one of your own worlds that has a reported tag \n2. Click worlds tab\n3. Click any other world listed there that you are not the author of\n4. Reported tags from your world persist.\nJust a minor UI bug.",
